# Copy to /etc/flow.env; chmod 600 /etc/flow.env
FLOW_HOST=127.0.0.1
FLOW_PORT=8090
FLOW_DATA_DIR=/www/wwwroot/flow/data
# Keep 1 for production HTTPS; use 0 only for local HTTP checks.
FLOW_COOKIE_SECURE=1
# Only when the site sits behind Cloudflare's proxy (orange cloud): then CF-Connecting-IP is the visitor's address.
# flowlang.cn and flow.jasa.hk are DNS-only, so leave it unset there (a visitor could write any address into that header).
# FLOW_TRUST_CF=1
# Sign-up codes the whole site mails an hour (default 300), so its mail address cannot flood other people's inboxes.
# FLOW_REGISTER_CODES_PER_HOUR=300
# Optional OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint; all values stay server-side.
FLOW_AI_URL=
FLOW_AI_MODEL=
FLOW_AI_KEY=
# Vertex AI / Agent Platform with ADC (instead of a static API key):
# FLOW_AI_PROVIDER=vertex
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-project-id
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=global
# FLOW_AI_MODEL=google/your-available-model-id
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/www/flow-secrets/adc.json

# Optional: a cheaper model for text-only calls (feedback, reading help, questions, dialogue). Audio and web
# search stay on the main model; if the text model fails or is switched off, the main model answers.
# One line, on the same gateway and key as above (FLOW_AI_URL / FLOW_AI_KEY): the gateway's console decides which
# vendor answers flow-text (DeepSeek, Qwen, Gemini …) and can switch it at any time (tools/ai-gateway/README.md).
# FLOW_TEXT_AI_MODEL=flow-text
# Or a separate service, with its own key (the main key is never sent to another address):
# FLOW_TEXT_AI_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions
# FLOW_TEXT_AI_MODEL=deepseek-chat
# FLOW_TEXT_AI_KEY=
# Per task (ai_routes.py): a task may ask another model name on the same gateway instead, e.g. flow-text-qwen37-plus, a
# model on Alibaba Cloud 百炼 (enterprise account) with Gemini as the gateway's backup line. ai_eval.py and the nightly
# check ask flow-eval-X instead, 例句预生成 flow-batch-X (the owner's own account), where the gateway has them. Which
# task asks which name is set in the xmc.hk console (运维 → AI 用量、费用和质量), which offers the gateway's flow-text*
# names; FLOW_AI_ROUTES is the server's default and FLOW_AI_CHOICES adds names when the gateway cannot be asked.
# Without either, every task stays on FLOW_TEXT_AI_MODEL.
# Write it without quotes: systemd's EnvironmentFile takes double quotes away (JSON would then not parse; it does
# tolerate that, but the plain forms are safer): one name for every task, or *=name,task=name pairs.
# FLOW_AI_ROUTES=flow-text-ds-flash
# FLOW_AI_ROUTES=*=flow-text-ds-flash,next-essay=flow-text
# FLOW_AI_CHOICES=flow-text-ds-flash
# 今日热点's news search on 百炼 instead of Gemini (chat_service.search_provider): a gateway search name on a 百炼
# upstream, asked through the gateway's /v1/search/completions (百炼's own search, which names its sources). When it
# fails, Gemini searches as before. Leave empty for Gemini only. Check it first with search_eval.py.
# FLOW_SEARCH_AI_MODEL=flow-search-ds-flash
# FLOW_SEARCH_STRATEGY=turbo
# Recordings of some tasks on 百炼 instead of Gemini (ai_routes.audio_route): Qwen-Omni through the gateway, the same
# prompt, Gemini when it fails. Same forms as FLOW_AI_ROUTES. 2026-11-25 (voice_eval.py): 3.5–4 s until the reply is
# heard instead of 13–16 s. 跟读 (next-shadow) and 发音 (next-say) too since the owner's 「不要交给gemini了，延迟太高了」
# (2026-11-25; shadow_eval.py compares the two on the same recordings). next-say only on a build whose 发音 takes a
# non-Gemini verdict as a reference (output_service.SAY_TRUSTED): Omni has heard a correct "think" as "zink".
# FLOW_AUDIO_ROUTES=next-dialog=flow-audio-omni-flash,next-retell=flow-audio-omni-flash,next-ielts=flow-audio-omni-flash,next-shadow=flow-audio-omni-flash,next-say=flow-audio-omni-flash
# No Gemini for learners (2026-11-25, the owner: 「换成国内已备案模型」; Gemini has no filing in China and a recording sent
# to it leaves the country): FLOW_MAIN_AI=off keeps the main model out of every learner request; then a failed text route
# goes to FLOW_BACKUP_AI_MODEL (another 百炼 model), a failed dialogue / retell / IELTS recording is written down by
# FLOW_ASR_AI_MODEL and answered by that backup, and 发音 is judged by speech recognition with FLOW_SAY_JUDGE=asr.
# FLOW_MAIN_AI=off
# FLOW_BACKUP_AI_MODEL=flow-text-qwen-plus
# Not for learners for now (Aliyun ticket 000CTT2X9T, 2026-11-25 13:58: qwen3-asr has no filing and will be retired;
# the owner: 「不用 qwen3-asr，先用 Omni」): leave these two unset. With FLOW_MAIN_AI=off, 发音 then has Qwen-Omni write down
# the word it hears (next-say's audio route, else next-dialog's) and judges that; FLOW_SAY_JUDGE=model keeps the old
# prompt (a reference only). A failed recording is tried once more on Omni. Set them only for a filed recognition model.
# That verdict is a reference only (never a mistake) until FLOW_SAY_COUNTS=on (the owner: 「先只作参考」, 2026-11-25);
# each verdict is logged without the account (say_judgements, 14 days) for the spot-check.
# FLOW_SAY_COUNTS=on
# FLOW_ASR_AI_MODEL=flow-audio-asr-flash
# FLOW_SAY_JUDGE=asr
# How long a recording may take on the main service (Gemini) before the learner is told, 15–85 seconds (default 85).
# FLOW_AUDIO_TIMEOUT=40
# How long the text service (DeepSeek on 百炼) may take before Gemini takes over, 15–85 seconds (default 45; its
# answers took at most 28 s on 内测版, and Gemini takes over only within 60 s).
# FLOW_TEXT_TIMEOUT=45

# Audio in Cloudflare R2 as well (tools/media/README.md): the bucket's own domain. A file listed in
# corpus_data/media-manifest.json but missing here is fetched from it once and kept; the page also plays from it by
# itself when this server cannot answer. Leave empty to serve only the audio on this server.
# FLOW_MEDIA_BASE=https://media.flowlang.cn

# Optional site-wide daily ceiling (UTC day); 0 disables it.
FLOW_AI_DAILY_LIMIT=0
# Per-account daily ceiling (UTC day, admins exempt); 0 disables it.
FLOW_AI_USER_DAILY_LIMIT=0

# Optional verified email recovery. Use a dedicated SMTP account/app password.
FLOW_PUBLIC_URL=https://flowlang.cn
# FLOW_SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
# FLOW_SMTP_PORT=465
# FLOW_SMTP_FROM=Flow <noreply@example.com>
# FLOW_SMTP_USER=noreply@example.com
# FLOW_SMTP_PASSWORD=replace-with-app-password

# v0.6 gateway audio support; upgrade.sh detects /health before enabling.
FLOW_AI_AUDIO=0

# Operator API for xmc.hk/flow/ (loopback only; proxied by xmc.hk behind Cloudflare Access). 0 disables it.
FLOW_ADMIN_PORT=0
# 运营后台的角色（r20）。写上管理员的邮箱（Cloudflare Access 登录用的那个），用逗号分开：这些人能看账号、生成重设密码链接、
# 看逐条回答和错误、导出问卷、生成今日一读、看操作记录。其他能登录后台的人只能看概览、学习数据、发版对比和问卷统计。
# 留空时，所有能登录后台的人都是管理员（和以前一样）。改完重启 flow。
FLOW_ADMIN_EMAILS=
# Optional fixed secret for the survey rate-limit hash; otherwise a random file in FLOW_DATA_DIR is used.
# FLOW_SURVEY_SALT=
